=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* Travel to the {n:Allied Ensign} (I-9) in {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)} (hug the left wall as soon as you come out).
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ghoyu's Reverie}.
* You will come across a Soldier, who immediately runs towards a {m:Trained Bat} and begins attacking.
** During this time, you will see messages that display how much attention he is giving to the fight:
*** The soldier seems unfocused...
*** The soldier has begun training harder!
*** The soldier is fighting with vigor!
* You may defeat the {m:Trained Bat} yourself once the soldier has begun fighting with vigor.
* Once the {m:Trained Bat} is defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
** If the soldier never gains focus, you lose the mission.
* After a short period, a Dawn Aureola will appear, allowing you to exit the area.
* Return and talk to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to Ghoyu's Reverie.
* The soldier will die if left alone, however he can cure himself.
* The Trained Bat lasts a long while, and seems to shift hate very often.

